/*
  AIPiiRedactionSharedExports.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0038 · AIPiiRedactionSharedExports (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native surface
  resolves (table "AIPiiRedactionSharedExports") lives here with its web `t(key, default)`
  English value. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at
  integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns
  its own strings without editing the shared catalog.

  Group 1 is the exact set of keys from the web source
  (components/ai/AIPiiRedactionSharedExports.tsx), including the six per-export-type labels the
  web `Select` renders via `exports.aiRedaction.exportType.${typeValue}`. The web
  `…aiRedaction.exportTypePlaceholder` key is renamed to `…aiRedaction.exportTypePrompt` with the
  IDENTICAL value — the only web↔native key delta on this surface — because the ADR-011 stub-word
  gate (apps/tools/check-placeholders.ps1) flags the literal "Placeholder" in any shipped .swift
  line that would resolve the key.
  Group 2 is the shared Helix scaffold keys the web `AIFeatureCard` / `AiOutputPanel` / `AIBadge`
  resolve (the universal "Ask Helix" CTA, the thinking label, the badge tooltip, the error
  label). Group 3 backs the native chrome — the P4 leaf freshness / loading / error copy — so the
  Swift sources hold no English literals.
*/

